ue la séparation, et 牛, le bœuf. Le Shuowen jiezi l'explique par le partage d'une bête assez grande pour être coupée en deux. Dans la forme actuelle, les deux points du haut viennent de 八, et le bœuf ne se reconnaît plus.","en":"In seal script, 半 combines 八, which marks division, with 牛, an ox. The Shuowen jiezi explains it as an animal big enough to be split in two. In the modern form, the two dots at the top come from 八, while the ox can no longer be made out.","roles":{}}},"扮":{"c":"扮","pinyin":"bàn","lectures":["bàn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","八","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0009","L5-0154","L7-0078","L7-5507"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se déguiser en, jouer le rôle de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se déguiser en, se faire passer pour ; jouer un rôle"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他扮成了一个老人。","pinyin":"Tā bàn chéng le yī ge lǎorén.","fr":"Il s'est déguisé en vieillard.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"拌":{"c":"拌","pinyin":"bàn","lectures":["bàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","半"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0083","L7-2070"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mélanger, remuer ; assaisonner","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"mélanger, remuer ; assaisonner en remuant"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她把米饭和菜拌在一起吃。","pinyin":"Tā bǎ mǐfàn hé cài bàn zài yīqǐ chī.","fr":"Elle mélange le riz et les légumes avant de manger.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"瓣":{"c":"瓣","pinyin":"bàn","lectures":["bàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辛","辛","瓜"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1711"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pétale ; quartier, gousse","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"pétale ; quartier (d'orange), gousse (d'ail)"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"quartier de, gousse de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他吃了一瓣橘子。","pinyin":"Tā chī le yī bàn júzi.","fr":"Il a mangé un quartier de mandarine.","statut":"relu"}],"origin